OL,3,GNEWSABarn loft transformed to support
OL,4,Abat colony
OL,5,
OL,6,FA barn loft has been transformed to
OL,7,Fsupport its resident colony of brown
OL,8,Flong-eared bats.
OL,10,FThe RSPB secured a #135,000 grant to
OL,11,Frestore a traditional Cumbrian spinning
OL,12,Fbarn - a site where farm workers spun
OL,13,Fsheep's wool - into a visitor's hub and
OL,14,Fconserve its bat colony in its loft at
OL,15,FWild Haweswater near Penrith.
OL,17,FThe site's manager, Annabel Rushton,
OL,18,Fsaid the bats were named because they
OL,19,Fhad "fantastic lugs on them", and were
OL,20,Famong soprano pipistrelle, common
OL,21,Fpipistrelle and Daubenton's bats at the
OL,22,Fsite.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
