OL,3,GNEWSABarn loft transformed to support
OL,4,Abat colony
OL,5,
OL,6,FRushton said there had been more
OL,7,Fentrances and exits created, more
OL,8,F"nooks and crannies for them to hide in
OL,9,Fand roost" and the building was heated
OL,10,Fahead of hibernation.
